Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:04.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于有了一个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finally had a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立了一个美满家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were building something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过猎魔人能拥有如此幸福的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's as close to happiness as I've ever seen a hunter get.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 待在那 - 我听到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben, just stay there. - I thought I heard you …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,本连提都不想提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben won't even talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在真的不是谈话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the worst time in the universe to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能以后再谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你推了我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoved my kid, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就得谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we do this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你和本…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and Ben…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和本不能跟你淌这滩浑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Ben can't be in this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法的牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的灵魂被困在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul is stuck in that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些记忆可谓十分不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty, those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道那些记忆会如何影响他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know what they'll do to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要这样做 - 别碰这个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do this. - Don't scratch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡骑士并不只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death didn't just.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你灵魂放回来 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}shove your soul back in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你和你遗忘的那些事中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put up the great wall of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起了一道「萨姆之墙」\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and the things that you don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trust me when I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得的那些事能杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the things you don't know could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:00:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆 回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:13.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 清醒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我带你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, got to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:58.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大瀑布专科学校 帕特森 新泽西州）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像被颗行星给撞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I got hit by a…Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运 我是一名医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, lucky for you, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你买了咖啡 吃的 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got joe, grub, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昏迷了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long was I out, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说 大概两三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, like two or three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.57,0:04:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你感觉是多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, what'd it feel like to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.57,0:04:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有一周那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a week, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想聊聊那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那个」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 不管那个是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你就像触电致死了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was like you were freakin' electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 那一点也不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I mean, it wasn't fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.07,0:04:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 我 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I'm…Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地狱 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was hell, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一脸的地狱相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a big, fat faceful of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过你可能会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever cross your mind that you could've died?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, come on. - I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可远不止什么「只是皮外伤」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And none of this "It's just a flesh wound" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们照你的方法做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause we did it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让你去探索记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let you go explore,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且所有我说过的糟糕的事也都发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every bad thing that I said would happen happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So guess what …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的就让它过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Past stays past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再碰那屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not kicking that wall again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我只能无视它了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm supposed to just ignore it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道我过去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might've done…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都干了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows what,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却要我就这么忘掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want me to just forget about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那些回忆压制下去 然后通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shove it down, and you let it come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力和酗酒来发泄\N{\fnArial\fs30}in spurts of violence and alcoholism.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来挺健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我挺有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没跟你开完笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你命悬一线了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life is on the line here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好争辩的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初你是一个没有灵魂的蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, first you were a-a soulless dickbag,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱说清楚没\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们转移一下你的注意力好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get your mind off it, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, up for a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看门人昨晚于大学实验室被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janitor murdered in a college lab last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都是锁好的 楼里也没人进出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors were locked, nobody else in or out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,新泽西州的帕特森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paterson, New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在那能碰到史努基（美国电视名人）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe we'll have a Snooki sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,史努基是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Snooki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看 这东西可真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out. This thing's friggin' awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我的情人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥啊 我们这是在工作 把它放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we're working. Put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把心掏给你 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a heart. - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真扫兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到硫磺味了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell sulfur?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们在一个实验室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're in a science lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是莉莎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,管好你自己的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 跟她说说话能要你命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with just talking to her, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 知心姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dr. Laura. That's …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,见解十分深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's very insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看 时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that … our time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂也疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts gone wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么鬼怪在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大哥在监视着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big brother's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从拖把老兄的女友那查到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd you find out from the, uh, mop jockey's girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道他是个好人 去做礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just how great he was … went to church,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,做慈善 看欢乐合唱团时给她按摩脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}donated to charity, rubbed her feet during "Glee."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just threw up in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我查了他的记录 很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Anyway, I checked his record … spotless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那栋科学大楼呢 有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the science building? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,05年建成 那块地方也很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built in '05. Nothing weird about the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前 最大的灾难就是某个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before this, the biggest mishap was some genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不小心将硫酸撒到了他的胯下\N{\fnArial\fs30}accidentally spilled sulfuric acid on his crotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都没有正经解剖过啥东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't even dissect anything good in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比青蛙大点的东西 他们用就Ipad\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything bigger than Kermit, they use an Ipad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 屁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a big steaming pile of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha, very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西在响\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个你在实验室调戏的解剖假人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That anatomy dummy you were molesting at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.61,0:11:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that's what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在指控我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you accusing me of?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有个解剖假人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there was an anatomy dummy there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and here…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, so, what, We've got…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面对的是一大帮杀人玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got a bunch of killer dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:10.98,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像 查奇（《鬼娃回魂》的主角）\N{\fnArial\fs30}like…Chucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 这简直\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, that's … that's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.91,0:12:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太他妈毛骨悚然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…friggin' creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果鬼魂能附身人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if ghosts can possess humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动物体 为什么他们不能附身这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … and move objects, why can't they possess this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我解释一下 蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}But riddle me this, bat boy …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂一般不会跨省作案 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts aren't exactly known for hopping county lines, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙袭击了一所学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one hits up a college.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又是一个工厂 要跨三个城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now a factory, what, three towns over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合常理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要查啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:50.31,Title,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢金·凯特罗尔（《欲望都市》的女主角）看我的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the way Kim Cattrall's lookin' at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙和上一个死者一样背景干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this dead guy's as squeaky clean as the last dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到任何污点 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find a speck of dirt on him. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's a speck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,女裁缝萝丝·布朗一年前失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, seamstress named Rose Brown went missing over a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察已经放弃搜寻工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, cops just gave up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次出现是在工厂 推测已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last seen at the factory, presumed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹妹伊莎贝尔尚存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survived by sister Isabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌50美元 鬼魂复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 bucks … vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拜访一下妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay sis a visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,接吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打了好多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛… - 妈妈有些不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you - Something's wrong with mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很糟 迪恩 - 怎么个糟法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's bad, Dean. - Define "bad."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 她不和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know. S-she won't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 让她接电话 - 她不会接电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, put her on the phone. - She won't come to the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 把电话拿给你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, get your mom and put her on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 她把门锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I can't. Her door's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她基本不下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}She barely gets out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 来帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just … just come help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我等下给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 五分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 我不能就这么离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, I-I can't just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you got to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这里事关生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we're talking life or death here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我能撑24小时 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I can handle it for 24 hours, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不想面对这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get you want to bury it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我得处理我的旧事 你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had to deal with my past year. You got to deal with yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你处理的可真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, and that worked so great for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萝丝很亲近吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you and Rose were close, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很小的时候父母就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our parents died when we were little,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们互相依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we had each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大方\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有颗宽大的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had the biggest heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有人总是为难她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But people gave her a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很羞涩 有点笨拙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was shy, a little awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让她成为容易被欺负的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that made her an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我这一生都在保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I've been defending her my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she appreciated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是互相的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it went both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也为我付出了非常多\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did more for me than anybody else ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, may I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公司几年前的圣诞派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a company Christmas party a couple years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也在萨尔兹曼世家工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you work at Salzman & Sons, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都在工厂干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everybody works at the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是萝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey, get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大学看门人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That college janitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到去年 他也一直在那个工厂工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked at the factory, too, until last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 萝丝一失踪他就辞职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he quit right after Rose's disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看来 那女孩在工厂肯定出过什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So fair bet something happened to that girl around that factory,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那里就是整件事的起因\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's call that joint ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但仍然解释不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but it still doesn't explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂怎么会出现在另一个地区的大学里\N{\fnArial\fs30}how a ghost ended up at a college in another zip code.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不像跨界似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like she hopped the blue line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去那个工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed to the factory now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一查清萝丝的事就打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call when I get the whole scoop on Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来公司多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long have you been here with the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里大约3年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here about three years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 这和我有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, w-what's this got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 只是例常询问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. Just a routine questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识萝丝·布朗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did you know Rose Brown?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字有点耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the name sounds kind of familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她之前在这儿当裁缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a seamstress here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went missing about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind taking a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, I s… I saw her around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能提供些关于她的有用信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you can tell me about her that might help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我也想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, I'd love to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我啥也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息时间结束了 我要迟到了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, I'm about to be late back from break, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来挺紧张 强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem nervous, Jonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的都是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys that died were my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然伤心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-of course I'm gonna be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的不是伤心 而是紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say upset. I said nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起什么就联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你来这儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look absolutely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是孩子想撮合咱俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been "Parent trapped."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,本告诉我情况紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben sent out a 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去约会 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going on a date, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想坐下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那个男人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who's the guy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dr. Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,多体面啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How respectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? That's how this is gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你打过6次电话 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called you six times, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你回过近百次电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I almost called you back about 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎 本一打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lis, Ben called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.29,0:19:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就放下手头的一切赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped everything and ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你想知道我是不是在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to know if I care …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有任何要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.99,0:19:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说点要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then ask for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回你的房间去 - 回你的房间去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to your room! - Go to your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I…I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你提要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以你的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't have it …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法得到我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not how you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手机一响 我想极小可能是你打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My phone rings, I think … tiny chance it's you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有可能是萨姆打给我说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}big chance it's Sam calling to tell me you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莎 - 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lis… - No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't apologize or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当我在这里的生活走上正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I get to this place where I'm okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就出现在我们家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you show up at our door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep doing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次在我以为再也见不到你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time I think I'm never gonna see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试着忘却你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从我们这里得到什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from us, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I flipping out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许是因为那些联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know, maybe 'cause of the feds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为戴夫和史蒂夫他妈的死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause Dave and Steve are freaking dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会再给我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…Call me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.13,0:22:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是个混蛋 所以那个鬼想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a ghost trying to kill you for being a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.23,0:22:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运 所有被问话的人里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky you are the most suspicious interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最可疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就料到会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured something like this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,料到会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured something like what would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我没时间和你详细解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, look, I don't have time for the big speech, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, brass tacks …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝丝回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.95,0:22:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太扯淡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会像你的朋友们一样挂掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're gonna end up like your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你告诉我你对萝丝做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you tell me what you did to Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.41,0:22:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to help you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个愚蠢的玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a stupid joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 人人都会开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I mean, you … you … you play jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没想到会那么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't think it was that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.31,0:23:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让萝丝以为有人暗恋她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made Rose think she had a secret admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那姑娘一辈子都没被人约出去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the girl had ever been asked out in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我们只是觉得她有点悲催\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, we just thought she was kind of pathetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们知道她会上钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…So we knew she'd take the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.76,0:23:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可怜的姑娘压根没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor girl never saw it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝丝 我觉得他喜欢你哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, Rose, I think he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.03,0:24:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那确实很贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.77,0:24:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道一帮男人凑一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know how it is when a group of guys get together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就爱比着谁更混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They … they act like jackasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.53,0:24:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 别这样嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 萝丝 开个玩笑嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rosey, it's just a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.35,0:24:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.93,0:24:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened so fast…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别这么不识逗嘛 萝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take a joke, Rosey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.98,0:24:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't mean for it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.49,0:25:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要干嘛 - 报警啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗 - 这是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.96,0:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是咱骗她来的 我还拽了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tricked her here. I grabbed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,最轻算是过失杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's involuntary manslaughter at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提还得是他们相信咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's if they even believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.95,0:25:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.31,0:25:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫说我们当时没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve said there was only one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.02,0:25:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look me in the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.69,0:25:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我一切与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me none of it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.91,0:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说你该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying you deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.79,0:25:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.76,0:25:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你们在哪儿埋的她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me where she's buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.09,0:25:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.72,0:25:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,峡谷路边的一块空地\N{\fnArial\fs30}a clearing off canyon run road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 你哪儿也别去 - 但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no. You're not going anywhere. - But I …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.97,0:25:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你没事了之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.73,0:26:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你乖乖待在盐线里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the salt line until I tell you you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让我整宿待在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just want me to stand here all night?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经算不错的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it getting off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 太扯淡了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.55,0:26:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,植物才杀不死僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plants could never kill a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会道歉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm gonna say "I'm sorry"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.06,0:26:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥我想要你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.05,0:26:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你把我骗到这儿来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you lied to get me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.89,0:26:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急情况嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.57,0:26:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈约个会不叫紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}A date's not an emergency, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.03,0:26:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都第三次了还不叫紧急吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is if it's the third one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.54,0:26:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看电视的 我知道那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch TV. I know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.75,0:27:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈是个大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your mom's a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.67,0:27:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她该出去约会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gets to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.62,0:27:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能道个歉 然后回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you just say "I'm sorry" and then come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.29,0:27:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不行还是不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't or won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.73,0:27:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你现在就是恨我妈了 - 啥 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, you hate mom now? - What? No, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是因为我了呗 - 本 别瞎想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So it's me. - Ben, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.23,0:27:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我怎么你了 我道歉还不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I did, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.70,0:27:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.62,0:27:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.61,0:27:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.81,0:27:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 总有一天 你会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, one day you'll, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大了就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get this when you're older.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿我当小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me like I'm six.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.69,0:27:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like this, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.96,0:27:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱某个人 那并不意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause you love someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.41,0:27:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要在他们身边 扰乱他们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean you should stick around and screw up their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.55,0:27:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:27:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得会有东西跟着你回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think something will follow you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.58,0:28:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.08,0:28:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想由于我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think my job turns me into somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我无法拥有一个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can't sit at your dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.93,0:28:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I stayed,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.01,0:28:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你变得跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd end up just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么把自己说得那么…坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you say it like you're so…bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我可绝不是你的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, trust me, I'm not someone you want to aim to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.37,0:28:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能听听我的意见吗 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't I get a vote? - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.65,0:28:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.35,0:28:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 这样你才能有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see, this way you got a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.05,0:28:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,实现自己想要的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}at living whatever life you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.28,0:28:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 可以有的选\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.48,0:28:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,选五种都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick five.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为和我在一起 只有这一条道走到黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause with me, there's just the one road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.77,0:28:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你骗人 迪恩 - 啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a liar, Dean. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.66,0:28:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说家人大过天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say family's so important,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 无论你多混蛋 都还是关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but … but what do you call people who … who care for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.39,0:28:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你的人 你当他们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}who love you even when you're a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你这是在抛弃家人 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're walking out on your family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 解决了 你安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's over. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.62,0:29:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Jonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这次当做新的开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this as a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.37,0:29:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不当混蛋 机会多得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of chances not to be a jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.02,0:30:45.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（麦克欧文酒吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.39,0:31:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.84,0:31:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝 咱要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hon…We're leaving…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.85,0:31:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾一下吧 带些必需品就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, pack up. Just the essentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.81,0:31:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想继续过我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is for us to move on with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.38,0:31:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.41,0:31:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.84,0:31:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.31,0:31:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都很难 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been really hard, Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.24,0:32:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是迪恩的二号替补电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean's other other cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.91,0:32:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you must know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.41,0:32:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 那事没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.76,0:32:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉尸体没能阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning the remains didn't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.48,0:32:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是跟别的什么还有关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got to be hooked to something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.36,0:32:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要去找她妹 回我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna head to the sister's now. Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.26,0:32:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数她的衣服我都捐出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave most of her clothes to the goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.38,0:32:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她也没多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't have much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.03,0:32:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.66,0:32:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.40,0:32:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在上学吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in school?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.84,0:32:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪所学校 - 大瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Uh, Great Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.48,0:33:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我猜一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me guess…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.70,0:33:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周你去过化学实验室和工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you were at the chem lab and the factory this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.87,0:33:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.50,0:33:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚有没有去过一家叫麦克欧文的酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you happen to stop by a bar called Mcowen's last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,工厂里的人都去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody from the factory goes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.66,0:33:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概一周去三次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stop in maybe three times a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.10,0:33:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.93,0:33:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这都是你的缘故 - 什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this is all about you. - What? What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.71,0:33:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些凶杀案 你的同事们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murders … your coworkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.32,0:33:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大学看门人\N{\fnArial\fs30}your college janitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.62,0:33:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊 你认为是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you … you think I could do something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.78,0:33:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.70,0:33:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我觉得你是整件事的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}But … but I think you're at the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.59,0:33:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.98,0:33:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴了萝丝的什么东西 戒指 手镯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you wearing of Rose's? A ring? A bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.65,0:33:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她的乳牙吊坠 是什么 - 你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her baby teeth in a locket? What? - You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.05,0:33:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.18,0:33:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … what do you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.20,0:33:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是萝丝的 - 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of Rose that you carry with you? - I-I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.85,0:34:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.28,0:34:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的身体里面有一样她的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the only thing I have of hers is a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十六岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 16,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把她的一个肾捐给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}she gave me one of her kidneys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.19,0:34:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的肾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her kidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.28,0:34:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please tell me what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.12,0:34:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.69,0:34:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你得跟我走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna need you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.18,0:34:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那女孩体内有「鬼肾」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that the girl with the haunted kidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.45,0:34:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.23,0:34:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大开眼界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just when you think you seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.01,0:34:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.99,0:34:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能直接烧了它啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't exactly burn the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.32,0:34:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要这个肾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she kind of needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.15,0:34:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能带着它到处走啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she can't just walk around with it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂和肾脏相联\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit's attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.44,0:34:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会利用她来找到它想报复的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna use her to get close to anyone it wants revenge on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.14,0:34:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会停止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna stop killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.41,0:34:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你什么意思 把肾从她身体里取出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what are you suggesting, that we cut it out of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.03,0:34:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.10,0:34:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她放在装满冰的浴缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her in a tub of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.27,0:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑个电话在她手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a phone taped to her hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.55,0:35:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以打电话给罗伯特医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should call Dr. Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.92,0:35:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能知道黑市上有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have some leads on some.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常的可替换的肾脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}non-haunted, black-market replacement kidneys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.94,0:35:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在一家肉店工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He works out of a butcher shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里很干净 你肯定会大吃一惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty clean. You'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.64,0:35:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得我们得靠巫术了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I think we have to go Hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.31,0:35:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巫术 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hoodoo? - Yeah, Hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.71,0:35:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最多是权宜之计 治标不治本啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more of a band-aid, not really a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.38,0:35:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少能争取些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It buys us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就去路易斯安那州\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Louisiana it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「伏都」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voodoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.73,0:35:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在瞎掰什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.90,0:35:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上应该叫巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's "hoodoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.38,0:35:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.08,0:35:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打住 伊莎贝尔 - 你们不是联调局的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, Isabel. - You're not feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.58,0:35:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请容我们解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let us explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.56,0:35:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.89,0:35:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,坑爹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.66,0:35:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.57,0:35:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.14,0:35:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她附身性爱娃娃 这又不是性爱娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She possesses sex dolls! This … this is not a sex doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.74,0:35:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you leave my baby alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.21,0:35:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.20,0:35:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑 跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.04,0:35:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 这里 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here, here, here. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.90,0:36:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.59,0:36:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.59,0:36:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.86,0:36:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.97,0:36:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事没事 我很好 你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'm good. You guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.56,0:36:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.87,0:36:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.10,0:36:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.58,0:37:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本意绝非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.57,0:37:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.31,0:37:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到她被鬼劫持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, considering she got carjacked by poltergeist,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.40,0:37:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸中的万幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.55,0:37:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我们到底做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what exactly did we do back there, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.22,0:38:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 赢得太不光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not putting it in the win column, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.87,0:38:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们救了几个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved a few dicks,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.43,0:38:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是杀了一个无辜的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}a-a-and we killed an innocent girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.83,0:38:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让我的孩子伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a heartbroken kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.90,0:38:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还令我的女人生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a woman who's so pissed at me…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.03,0:38:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算明白你说面对过去是什么意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see what you mean about facing your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.99,0:38:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.49,0:38:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是超赞 谢谢 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it's awesome. Thanks. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.61,0:38:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只会把事情搞得乱七八糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, all we do is make a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.61,0:38:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偶尔还拯救生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do save lives, now and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.38,0:38:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.84,0:38:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.15,0:38:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运女神老是不眷顾我们 我很郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired of all the bad luck, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.22,0:38:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.40,0:38:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎魔这工作也就意味着走霉运\N{\fnArial\fs30}bad luck is kind of in the job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.63,0:38:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 也不全是倒霉事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two, it's not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.27,0:38:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.07,0:38:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 撒旦已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, at least Satan's left the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.16,0:38:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.55,0:38:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.76,0:38:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 我又有灵魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a soul because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.33,0:38:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没谢过你 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thanked you for that, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.21,0:39:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's all good, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.58,0:39:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.38,0:39:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是你 你也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have done the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.03,0:39:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.15,0:39:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保持低调 继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we keep our heads down, keep swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.54,0:39:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有失 但是希望能得到更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll lose some. Hopefully, we'll win more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.83,0:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.72,0:39:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.83,0:39:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何 反正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, for what it's worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.25,0:39:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我罩你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.00,0:39:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
